message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "SAD2XS: The unofficial Strategic Accelerator Design (SAD) to Xsuite converter"
abstract: >-
  SAD2XS converts Strategic Accelerator Design (SAD) lattices into the Xsuite
  format. It reads a SAD lattice file and produces an Xtrack Line object,
  together with generated lattice and optics files.
type: software
